            "value" : "El comando \u001b[34;1mimgmount\u001b[0m solo es para montar archivos de imágenes de disco.\nPara montar carpetas, use el comando \u001b[34;1mmount\u001b[0m .\n"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La commande \u001b[34;1mimgmount\u001b[0m sert uniquement à monter fichiers d'image disque.\nPour monter des dossiers, utilisez la commande \u001b[34;1mmount\u001b[0m.\n"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The \u001b[34;1mimgmount\u001b[0m command is for mounting disk image files only.\nTo mount folders, use the \u001b[34;1mmount\u001b[0m command.\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
