    "SHELL_CMD_CALL_HELP_LONG" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usage: \u001b[34;1mcall [path/to/batch.bat] [arguments]\u001b[0m\n\nThis command is only useful within batch files: it will run the specified\nbatch file and then allow the original batch file to continue.\n\nIf you run a batch file from another batch file without using \u001b[32;1mcall\u001b[0m, then\nthe original batch file will exit without completing the rest of its commands.\n"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uso:   \u001b[34;1mcall [ruta/a/batch.bat] [argumentos]\u001b[0m\n\nEste comando solo es útil dentro de un archivo por lotes: ejecutará el archivo  por lotes especificado y entonces permitirá continuar al archivo por lotes      original.\n\nSi ejecuta el archivo por lotes desde otro archivo por lotes sin usar \u001b[32;1mcall\u001b[0m,     entonces el archivo por lotes original saldrá sin completar el resto de\ncomandos.\n"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usage : \u001b[34;1mcall [chemin/de/commandes.bat] [arguments]\u001b[0m\n\nCette commande est utile uniquement dans les fichiers de commandes : elle\nexécutera le fichier de commandes spécifié et ensuite autorisera le fichier de\ncommandes original à continuer.\n\nSi vous exécutez un fichier de commandes à partir d'un autre fichier de\ncommandes sans utiliser \u001b[32;1mcall\u001b[0m, le fichier de commandes original se\nfermera sans terminer le reste de ses commandes.\n"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usage: \u001b[34;1mcall [path/to/batch.bat] [arguments]\u001b[0m\n\nThis command is only useful within batch files: it will run the specified\nbatch file and then allow the original batch file to continue.\n\nIf you run a batch file from another batch file without using \u001b[32;1mcall\u001b[0m, then\nthe original batch file will exit without completing the rest of its commands.\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usage: \u001b[34;1mcall [path/to/batch.bat] [arguments]\u001b[0m\n\nThis command is only useful within batch files: it will run the specified\nbatch file and then allow the original batch file to continue.\n\nIf you run a batch file from another batch file without using \u001b[32;1mcall\u001b[0m, then\nthe original batch file will exit without completing the rest of its commands.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
